From 52b80f75572e3f3aca08a1feac59e3a5f9cfe2c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Zhu <mitchzhu@microsoft.com>
Date: Thu, 22 May 2025 23:55:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add multi-snapshotter support

Upstream v2.2.3+ already adopted the runtimeHandler parameter for
snapshotterFromPodSandboxConfig and the local snapshotter variable in
sandbox_run.go (with a different code path that resolves snapshotter via
RuntimeSnapshotter(ociRuntime)); the only Azure Linux additions retained
here are:
  - Plumbing a snapshotter override through CRIImageService.PullImage so
    sandbox_run can request an image be pulled into a specific snapshotter.
  - The Snapshotters set on the in-memory Image so ensureImageExists can
    avoid pulling when the image is already present in the desired
    snapshotter.
